## MISSING FEATURES (from the spec)

### M1: No inline editing on time entries list
Spec says "Inline edit on click" and "Inline editing of any time entry without modal popups". Currently, clicking an entry opens a separate edit page (/time_entries/:id/edit). Inline editing is a core UX improvement for a time tracking app -- Toggl and Clockify both support this.

### M2: No manual entry mode toggle
Spec says "Toggle between timer and manual entry (duration or start/end times)" in the timer bar. Currently only timer mode exists in the navbar. There should be a toggle to switch to manual entry mode where you enter start/end times directly.

### M3: No bulk actions on time entries
Spec says "Bulk actions: delete, change project, toggle billable". Checkboxes are present on each entry but there is no bulk action bar that appears when entries are selected. The checkboxes are non-functional.

### M4: No "quick-entry row" at top of time entries list
Spec mentions a quick-entry row at the top of the time entries list for fast manual entry without navigating to /time_entries/new.

### M5: No date range presets on reports
Spec says "Date range selector with presets: today, this week, last week, this month, last month, this year, custom range". Reports currently show raw date inputs with no preset buttons.

### M6: No drill-down from Summary Report to Detailed Report
Spec says "Click any group to drill down into Detailed Report with that filter pre-applied". The project names in the Summary Report table are plain text, not links.

### M7: No shareable report links
Spec mentions "Shareable via URL with encoded filters". Report filters are not encoded in the URL, so you can't bookmark or share a specific report view.

### M8: No weekly report export (CSV/PDF)
Detailed Report has CSV and PDF export buttons. Summary and Weekly reports do not. All report types should support export.

### M9: No "This week vs last week" chart on dashboard
Dashboard shows "-14% vs last week" text, which is good. But the spec mentions a visual comparison. A small sparkline or comparison bar would make this more meaningful.

### M10: No user profile / settings page
No way to edit user name, timezone, default hourly rate, or password from within the app. The user dropdown only has "Sign Out" and "New Workspace". There should be a profile/settings page.

### M11: No workspace settings page
Spec mentions workspace settings (default currency, week start day, time format 12h/24h). There is no settings page accessible from the UI.

### M12: No Timesheet template saving
Spec says "Save as template for recurring weeks". Not implemented.

### M13: Integration model stub exists but no UI
The Integration table exists in the database (good for Phase 2 prep) but there's no placeholder or settings panel for it.

